{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aPhil and Leonardo\u300bis a 2D platformer where you\u2019ll control both the blind elder Phil and the piglet Leonardo to explore the world. Leonardo isn\u2019t just an ordinary piglet\u2014he suddenly appeared when Phil was pulled into this otherworld. Is it a coincidence, or... Sometimes Leonardo acts as a mount to carry Phil around; other times, he becomes a shield to block attacks and protect Phil from harm. Though Phil is blind, he plays an indispensable and crucial role in the game too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath this seemingly cute, fairy-tale-like world lies a thrilling, twist-filled story\u2014and the truth of the world is far more complex than it first appears. Everything awaits you to explore alongside them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935220?t=1768135913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935220?t=1768135913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935220/99189924837428c948dec3d5944a3fb1ba1224db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768135913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935220/99189924837428c948dec3d5944a3fb1ba1224db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768135913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aPhil and Leonardo\u300bis a 2D platformer where you\u2019ll control both the blind elder Phil and the piglet Leonardo to explore the world. Leonardo isn\u2019t just an ordinary piglet\u2014he suddenly appeared when Phil was pulled into this otherworld. Is it a coincidence, or... Sometimes Leonardo acts as a mount to carry Phil around; other times, he becomes a shield to block attacks and protect Phil from harm. Though Phil is blind, he plays an indispensable and crucial role in the game too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath this seemingly cute, fairy-tale-like world lies a thrilling, twist-filled story\u2014and the truth of the world is far more complex than it first appears. Everything awaits you to explore alongside them.</p>","developers":["Team OoTong"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935220/3210ad5a9b1e49ea7d78d3d98a048ac22cc42a69/header.jpg?t=1768135913","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3935220/823367562/4b036be12cebcaeaae4ef7c4f49cc2191adfaa12/1768134777/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768135910","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3935220/823367562/4b036be12cebcaeaae4ef7c4f49cc2191adfaa12/1768134777/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768135910","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3935220/823367562/4b036be12cebcaeaae4ef7c4f49cc2191adfaa12/1768134777/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768135910","id":257263106,"name":"Promotional video EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257263106/a73d73a168faa6c504c194f875cac113a7a1fc34/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768135910"}],"name":"Phil and Leonardo","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u4e0d\u5012\u7fc1 - $6.99 USD","packageid":1382471,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":699}],"title":"Buy Phil and Leonardo"}],"packages":[1382471],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"